{"v":4,"catch":"RITE 是一款高速精密平台遊戲，您必須在其中克服一系列嚴苛的考驗，這是每個 Nim 的通行儀式。","desc":"找到鑰匙並到達出口以繼續下一個試煉，並可能沿途收集一些金幣。誰知道呢，這對那些喜歡殘酷挑戰的人來說可能很有價值。\n\n對於新老平台遊戲的粉絲來說，RITE 擁有 160 個精心打造的關卡、流暢且響應迅速的控制、豐富的像素藝術以及 Grand Prize Big Fuzz 的原創配樂。","publisher":"Pond Games","release":"2022-08-25","genres":["冒險","動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/82dab3b5e1e8aaa3239913868fe7ebd67b946da5369904e439e953bfe83860c3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/18f36553a7a1ec82ee978fda8df1c8c908820bf95a1fae8b8cbacc6480f079b4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bc845515db141e59eeba717bef0ce3829f6926eb195cef8b44434bce4f6e7bd0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a8019171353915f20efc73c2edee0a35644b6603d85843a61f61a8efa71551aa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/abd4857d619bd6d8ca819fadf073b8d271a34fbf930cdd3fce000bfecbdd7810.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b4dc436ef127968fecf6dec42176720d3fdf06df77a419b5c2e9b2ea58d200c8.jpg"],"titleId":"0100a56016734000","dlc":[]}